Swallow is a 2019 psychological thriller film written and directed by Carlo Mirabella-Davis and
starring Haley Bennett, Austin Stowell, Elizabeth Marvel, David Rasche, and Denis O'Hare.

12
01:07:03,529 --> 01:07:09,529
Its plot follows a young woman who, emotionally stifled in her marriage and
domestic life, develops an impulse to consume inedible objects.

13
01:12:38,823 --> 01:12:44,823
The film had its world premiere at the Tribeca Film Festival on April 28, 2019.

14
01:18:14,117 --> 01:18:20,117
